        <mxCell id="pay_note" value="&lt;b&gt;1-TO-MANY RELATIONSHIP RATIONALE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;If a customer lets the 5-minute KHQR timer run out, the order is NOT deleted. A 15-minute grace period holds the stock while a fresh payment row is created for the new KHQR attempt." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF9C3;strokeColor=#CA8A04;fontColor=#854D0E;fontSize=11;align=left;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
